    "title": "AutoExpreso M\u00f3vil",
    "description": "AutoExpreso M\u00f3vil is the official application created to manage your account of the electronic toll collection system on the roads of Puerto Rico, in this application you can:\r\n \r\n\u2022 View and recharge your available balance\r\n\u2022 View your latest transactions\r\n\u2022 View your violations and pending transactions\r\n\u2022 Pay selected violations\r\n\u2022 View existing vehicles related to your AutoExpreso account\r\n\u2022 Add and Remove vehicles from your AutoExpreso account\r\n\u2022 Join the auto-recharge service and manage the credit card information to use\r\n\u2022 View and update your contact information\r\n\u2022 Be alerted via mobile notification when your balance is low\r\n\u2022 Be alerted via mobile notification when you have insufficient funds",
    "descriptionHTML": "AutoExpreso M\u00f3vil is the official application created to manage your account of the electronic toll collection system on the roads of Puerto Rico, in this application you can:<br> <br>\u2022 View and recharge your available balance<br>\u2022 View your latest transactions<br>\u2022 View your violations and pending transactions<br>\u2022 Pay selected violations<br>\u2022 View existing vehicles related to your AutoExpreso account<br>\u2022 Add and Remove vehicles from your AutoExpreso account<br>\u2022 Join the auto-recharge service and manage the credit card information to use<br>\u2022 View and update your contact information<br>\u2022 Be alerted via mobile notification when your balance is low<br>\u2022 Be alerted via mobile notification when you have insufficient funds",
